<title>USA: Flotek, Cherny end merger talks.</title>
<headline>Flotek, Cherny end merger talks.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flotek Industries Inc said on Tuesday that it and Cherny Holdings Ltd of Australia have ended their merger talks because they could not agree on an appropriate valuation.</p>
<p>The two companies will continue the agreement under which Flotek markets Cherny products for the oil industry, including the Cherny Stuffing Box sealing mechanism for oil wells.</p>
<p>Flotek is an oilfield services company.</p>
</text>
